{
  "name": "Customer on a monthly subscription plan, billed in advance",
  "description": "A reusable 'Pro monthly' plan template ($49/month, billed on the 1st, earned over the month) is the price book entry; each customer contract binds it with its own start and end dates. Acceptance activates the contract, the scheduled bill claims $49 into deferred revenue, the Stripe payment is recorded as the receipt, and the completed month recognizes subscription revenue (4110). MRR comes from recurringValue, not from cash. Cancellation after the paid month terminates the contract; July's MRR stays in the history and August's is zero.",
